WEBVTT

0.1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.125
Peer-reviewed Terminal-Bench and SWE-agent studies show different scores from the same model with different harnesses.

0.1.2
00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:15.675
Codex beat Terminus with GPT-5; Terminus outscored Claude Code with Opus 4.5.

0.1.3
00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:20.200
These historical comparisons do not rank today's products.

0.2.1
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:31.175
With GPT-4 Turbo, SWE-agent raised success from 11% to 18% against a shell, both with demonstrations.

0.2.2
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:35.125
The interface changed; the model weights did not.

0.3.1
00:00:36.225 --> 00:00:42.725
This independent tour introduces omp, a Pi fork with integrated developer tools.

0.3.2
00:00:43.025 --> 00:00:48.725
We are not affiliated with Stencil Labs; our snapshot is October 2026.

0.3.3
00:00:49.025 --> 00:00:57.400
Badges distinguish peer-reviewed work, preprints, technical reports, first-party accounts, secondary sources, and anecdotes.

0.3.4
00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.450
The harness is part of the result, not decoration.
